OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock' of first England farmer
OL,4,Ahit by bird flu this season
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer hit by England's first
OL,7,Foutbreak of avian flu this season has
OL,8,Fsaid the loss of 32,000 egg-laying
OL,9,Fbirds is likely to cost her business
OL,10,Fmore than #100,000.
OL,12,FCatherine Armstrong, who has a
OL,13,Ffree-range farm near Belford,
OL,14,FNorthumberland, told the BBC of the
OL,15,F"shock" of her worst fears coming true
OL,16,Fwhen she found "a carpet of dead birds"
OL,17,Fin her barns this week.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
