OL,3,GNEWSA'Shock' of first England farmer
OL,4,Ahit by bird flu this season
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe outbreak's source is not yet known
OL,7,Fbut the virus is thought to have been
OL,8,Fbrought onto the site, which has strict
OL,9,Fbiosecurity measures, by wild birds.
OL,10,FThe farm's remaining poultry were
OL,11,Fculled.
OL,13,FThe Animal and Plant Health Agency
OL,14,F(APHA) has put control measures in
OL,15,Fplace to contain the outbreak but
OL,16,Fwarned cases were likely to rise.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
